        },
        {
          "text": "Maana BWANA wa majeshi Mungu wa Israeli, asema hivi, Kama hasira yangu, na ghadhabu yangu, ilivyomwagwa juu ya hao wakaao Yerusalemu, ndivyo ghadhabu yangu itakavyomwagwa juu yenu, mtakapoingia Misri; nanyi mtakuwa apizo, na ajabu, na laana, na aibu; wala hamtapaona mahali hapa tena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
